om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note origsel_indep: independent recomputer of the ORIGSEL v1.1 report in pure seeded OM-2.
note usage: origsel_indep REC ALLOW V1 IMG_M1 IMG_SH IMG_UN SELECT_OM OMEXP_OM KAPPA_OM
note        origsel_indep --selftest
note        origsel_indep --fnv FILE

